{"id":"3c2e7637f8c4eeac","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-empty-covering-sieve.md","title":"Theorem — Effect of an Empty Covering Sieve","display":"Theorem — Effect of an Empty Covering Sieve","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-empty-covering-sieve","aliases":["14-thm-empty-covering-sieve"],"display":"Theorem — Effect of an Empty Covering Sieve","depends_on":["[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]","[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","[[14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-empty-covering-sieve"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-empty-covering-sieve</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Effect of an Empty Covering Sieve"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3fcbbf29a7947555\" href=\"?note=3fcbbf29a7947555\" title=\"14-df-grothendieck-topology\">14-df-grothendieck-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e21364f5dcced9e7\" href=\"?note=e21364f5dcced9e7\" title=\"14-df-site-sheaf-category\">14-df-site-sheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b75f5f3e37180e81\" href=\"?note=b75f5f3e37180e81\" title=\"14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf\">14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\((\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 是小站点，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 为对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为层。空筛 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\">\\(\\varnothing\\)</span> 的相容族是空函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|F(C)|=1\">\\(|F(C)|=1\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(C)\">\\(F(C)\\)</span> 恰有一个元素。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\varnothing\\in J(C)\\land\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(F,\\mathcal C,J)\\to|F(C)|=1,\\\\\n\\varnothing\\in J(C)\\to\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\ (\\varnothing\\in J(D)).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\varnothing\\in J(C)\\land\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(F,\\mathcal C,J)\\to|F(C)|=1,\\\\\n\\varnothing\\in J(C)\\to\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\ (\\varnothing\\in J(D)).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：III.2 覆盖逆像稳定与 III.4 唯一粘合条件，印刷页 109–111、121–123；DjVu 第 60–61、66–67 图页。以下为空覆盖的直接推论。空积是单元素集合，空相容族的唯一粘合给出第一式；空筛的任意逆像仍空，由覆盖稳定性得第二式。此边界说明不应禁止空覆盖，也不应忘记唯一性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-grothendieck-topology","status":"resolved","id":"3fcbbf29a7947555","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-site-sheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"e21364f5dcced9e7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf","status":"resolved","id":"b75f5f3e37180e81","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"|F(C)|=1","display":false},{"tex":"F(C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\varnothing\\in J(C)\\land\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(F,\\mathcal C,J)\\to|F(C)|=1,\\\\\n\\varnothing\\in J(C)\\to\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\ (\\varnothing\\in J(D)).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1327,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-empty-covering-sieve|Theorem — Effect of an Empty Covering Sieve]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-208","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-empty-covering-sieve]]"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-empty-covering-sieve]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-empty-covering-sieve]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-114","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-empty-covering-sieve|Theorem — Effect of an Empty Covering Sieve]]"}],"outgoing":["3fcbbf29a7947555","e21364f5dcced9e7","b75f5f3e37180e81"]}